# Build output
bin/
obj/
*.nupkg
TestResults/

# IDE / OS
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Factorio Mod Studio working folders
.fmstudio/
dist/

# Local workspace for the UI (your mods under development)
/mods/*
!/mods/README.md

# graphify (optional code knowledge graph, see docs/graphify.md): derived data and the Obsidian vault
graphify-out/

# Local-only Claude Code integration written by `tools/graphify/setup.* --hooks`:
# CLAUDE.md and .claude/settings.json contain machine-specific hook paths (the absolute path of the
# graphify executable), so they must never be committed.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Local backups (e.g. of the web UI before a redesign): never committed
/backups/

# Local sandbox test environment (see .sandbox/): never committed
/.sandbox/
